## AD-024

**IDENTIFIER:** AD-024
**TITLE:** The Work Lifecycle Standard Shall Reference the Architecture Decision Standard as the Governing Standard for Architecture Decision Behaviour
**STATUS:** Approved — Awaiting Execute
**REGISTERED:** 2026-07-03
**INITIATIVE:** INI-003
**OWNER:** Black Umbrella Governance
**SOURCE PROPOSAL:** WORK_LIFECYCLE_STANDARD_AMENDMENT_001_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
**TEMPORARY REFERENCE:** AD-A

### Decision Statement

The Black Umbrella Work Lifecycle Standard shall reference the Black Umbrella Architecture Decision Standard as the governing standard for all Architecture Decision behaviour produced within the lifecycle.

### Context

The Work Lifecycle Standard and the Architecture Decision Standard govern complementary aspects of the same operational system. The WLS governs lifecycle progression. The AD Standard governs the Architecture Decisions produced within that lifecycle. Without an explicit cross-reference in the WLS, each standard exists as an independent document with no formal acknowledgement of its relationship to the other. This creates a traceability gap between lifecycle governance and decision governance.

### Rationale

An explicit cross-reference establishes that the two standards are complementary, not separate. It ensures consumers of the WLS are directed to the AD Standard for Architecture Decision behaviour, and prevents future interpretations that treat the two standards as independent systems. The reference is declarative — it acknowledges the governing relationship, not an operational dependency.

### Impact

A new section shall be added to the Work Lifecycle Standard acknowledging that the Architecture Decision Standard governs Architecture Decision behaviour. All future revisions of the WLS shall preserve this cross-reference. AIOS shall treat this cross-reference as an expression of the governing relationship between the two standards and shall not override or bypass either standard during implementation.

### Governance Status

- **Proposal:** WORK_LIFECYCLE_STANDARD_AMENDMENT_001_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
- **Founder Approval:** Granted — 2026-07-03
- **Registered:** 2026-07-03
- **Queue Status:** Awaiting Execute
- **Supersedes:** None
- **Superseded By:** None

### References

- Black Umbrella Architecture Decision Standard
- Black Umbrella Work Lifecycle Standard
- WORK_LIFECYCLE_STANDARD_AMENDMENT_001_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md (Amendment D)

