## AD-025

**IDENTIFIER:** AD-025
**TITLE:** The Approved Work Queue Is Superseded by the Approved Decision Queue
**STATUS:** Approved — Awaiting Execute
**REGISTERED:** 2026-07-03
**INITIATIVE:** INI-003
**OWNER:** Black Umbrella Governance
**SOURCE PROPOSAL:** WORK_LIFECYCLE_STANDARD_AMENDMENT_001_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
**TEMPORARY REFERENCE:** AD-B

### Decision Statement

The concept of the Approved Work Queue within the Black Umbrella Work Lifecycle Standard is superseded by the Approved Decision Queue. All references to the Approved Work Queue within the WLS and its related artefacts shall be updated accordingly.

### Context

The Work Lifecycle Standard originally defined an Approved Work Queue — a holding area for approved Proposals awaiting a Founder Execute instruction. The Architecture Decision Standard introduced a more precise governance model in which it is registered Architecture Decisions, not Proposals, that carry governance authority post-approval. The Approved Work Queue concept is inconsistent with this model. Retaining it alongside the Approved Decision Queue would create ambiguity about what the queue contains and how it is consumed.

### Rationale

Replacing the Approved Work Queue with the Approved Decision Queue resolves the naming and conceptual inconsistency. Proposals remain as historical approval artefacts. Registered Architecture Decisions become the operative governance records and the content of the queue. This change aligns the WLS with the AD Standard and ensures both standards describe a coherent, unified governance model.

### Impact

The term "Approved Work Queue" is removed from the Work Lifecycle Standard and all related artefacts. It is replaced with "Approved Decision Queue" throughout. The section formerly named "Approved Work Queue" within the WLS is renamed to "Approved Decision Queue". All references in Stage definitions, success criteria, and out-of-scope sections are updated to use the new term.

### Governance Status

- **Proposal:** WORK_LIFECYCLE_STANDARD_AMENDMENT_001_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
- **Founder Approval:** Granted — 2026-07-03
- **Registered:** 2026-07-03
- **Queue Status:** Awaiting Execute
- **Supersedes:** None
- **Superseded By:** None

### References

- Black Umbrella Architecture Decision Standard
- Black Umbrella Work Lifecycle Standard
- WORK_LIFECYCLE_STANDARD_AMENDMENT_001_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md (Amendment A)
- AD-010 (Architecture Decisions Are Registered Immediately Following Founder Approval)

