## AD-028

**IDENTIFIER:** AD-028
**TITLE:** The Commitment Is the Primary Operational Object of Black Umbrella
**STATUS:** Approved — Awaiting Execute
**REGISTERED:** 2026-07-03
**INITIATIVE:** INI-003
**OWNER:** Black Umbrella Governance
**SOURCE PROPOSAL:** COMMITMENT_STANDARD_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
**TEMPORARY REFERENCE:** AD-A

### Decision Statement

The Commitment is the primary operational object of Black Umbrella. A Commitment represents an organisational commitment to achieve a defined operational outcome and is the central object through which Black Umbrella performs governed work.

### Context

Prior to the Commitment Standard, Black Umbrella had defined governance objects (Proposals, Architecture Decisions) and lifecycle stages (Work Lifecycle Standard), but had not defined the operational object that these structures exist to serve. The governance model was complete. The operational model had no named centre. Work, projects, and outcomes were referenced informally without a first-class object to carry operational identity, state, and traceability.

### Rationale

A first-class operational object is required for AIOS to orchestrate work, for the Founder to have a coherent view of what Black Umbrella is doing, and for Offices to have a clear understanding of what they are fulfilling. Without a named operational object, every system built on top of the governance model would need to invent its own concept of "the thing being done." Naming the Commitment as the primary operational object ensures all future standards, systems, and tools orbit the same concept.

### Impact

All future Operating Standards, AIOS design, Office standards, dashboard design, and operational tooling shall treat the Commitment as the primary operational object. Governance authorises Commitments. Architecture Decisions constrain them. Operating Areas execute them. Offices fulfil them. AIOS orchestrates them.

### Governance Status

- **Proposal:** COMMITMENT_STANDARD_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
- **Founder Approval:** Granted — 2026-07-03
- **Registered:** 2026-07-03
- **Queue Status:** Awaiting Execute
- **Supersedes:** None
- **Superseded By:** None

### References

- Black Umbrella Commitment Standard
- COMMITMENT_STANDARD_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md

