## AD-072

**IDENTIFIER:** AD-072
**TITLE:** AIOS Shall Prepare the Complete Operational Evidence Package for Stage 5 Review
**STATUS:** Approved — Awaiting Execute
**REGISTERED:** 2026-07-03
**INITIATIVE:** INI-001
**OWNER:** Black Umbrella Governance
**SOURCE PROPOSAL:** AIOS_STANDARD_PROPOSAL_2026-07-03_V1.md
**TEMPORARY REFERENCE:** AD-J

### Decision Statement

AIOS shall prepare the complete operational evidence package for Founder review at Stage 5. The package shall include: Commitment summary, Operating Area completion status, Deliverable verification history, Quality Standard compliance, Dependency Graph completion, Exception history, Operational Outcome, execution metrics, and complete operational timeline.

### Context

Stage 5 review requires objective operational evidence to support Founder strategic evaluation. Without a comprehensive evidence package, the Founder cannot make an informed strategic judgment. AIOS is the authoritative source of operational history and is therefore the appropriate body to prepare this evidence.

### Rationale

AIOS preparation of the Stage 5 evidence package ensures the Founder receives complete, objective, governance-derived operational data. The Founder adds strategic evaluation to objective evidence. Neither can substitute for the other. AIOS preparation of evidence is a deterministic consequence of the Commitment entering Under Review.

### Impact

AIOS shall automatically generate the Stage 5 evidence package when a Commitment enters Under Review. The package shall be presented to the Founder before the Stage 5 review is conducted. The package shall be derived entirely from AIOS Operational History — no assessment or summary by AIOS is permitted.

### Governance Status

