# Register Metadata

## AD-AIOS-101 — The Operating Workforce: Offices, Authority Levels L0–L4, Build-Now-Activate-Later

### Classification: Governance + Architecture — requires Founder approval to amend

**Initiative:** INI-001 (AIOS Platform Operations)

### Summary

On the Founder's directive of 2026-08-22 ("Build the Black Umbrella / ZYRA
AI Operating Workforce... DESIGN AND SET UP THE AUTOMATIONS, OFFICES,
AGENTS, TRIGGERS, PERMISSIONS AND WORKFLOWS — BUT DO NOT ACTIVATE/SCHEDULE
THE AUTOMATIONS YET"), AIOS gains a designed operating workforce. Ruling
principle, his words: **"AIOS handles noise. I handle decisions."**

### Decision

1. The existing four dispatch offices (Founder, Development, Research,
   Security — AD-AIOS-100 bindings) remain the ONLY dispatch targets.
   The Founder's seventeen requested functions are mapped onto them as
   DESKS (classified EXISTING / MODIFY / NEW / FUTURE — audit in
   AIOS_WORKFORCE_CURRENT_VERSION_V1 §2) rather than duplicated.
2. Authority model ratified: L0 Observe · L1 Prepare · L2 Organise ·
   L3 Act-internally (per-item Founder approval) · L4 External
   (Founder only). STANDING CAP: nothing above L2 activates in the
   first wave; external email is draft-only until the Founder's
   explicit standing change; spending, publishing, production changes
   and destructive actions remain Founder-controlled.
3. Every automation carries the full governance record (purpose,
   trigger, inputs, systems, permissions, allowed/forbidden, output,
   escalation, failure behaviour, audit, owner, status, cost) in
   WORKSPACE_DATA/workforce/workforce_registry.json — 19 desks, 21
   automations at filing, every one DRAFT or READY — NOT ACTIVE.
4. Cross-office routing: one incident spine — corroborate across desks,
   ONE issue, ONE OA, ONE Founder item (orchestrator_engine gains the
   correlation duty at activation).
5. Professional escalation is explicit: legal→solicitor, tax→accountant,
   security incident→specialist, HR→professional; AI opinion is never
   dressed as professional sign-off. ZYRA safety reports get a dedicated
   fast-lane, never the ordinary support queue.
6. Activation is gated by OA-AIOS-346: Founder review of the workforce
   document + registry, then per-automation approval with OPF budget
   named. The 11 legacy paused automations revive only THROUGH this
   catalogue.

### Consequences

The Team space renders the full workforce grouped BLACK UMBRELLA / ZYRA /
SHARED SERVICES with statuses; nothing schedules, dispatches or spends
until the gate clears. Documentation: AIOS_WORKFORCE_CURRENT_VERSION_V1.md
(SYSTEM/ARCHITECTURE); build record OA-AIOS-345; activation gate
OA-AIOS-346.

